VALUES ('YouTube 缩略图 - 适用于 Nano Banana Pro 的分屏场景‘发薪日之前和之后’提示', '一个年轻男子的超现实分屏场景。左侧：在一个凌乱的小房间里坐在床上，面容疲惫，钱包空空，灯光昏暗，心情沮丧。右侧：同一个男子在发薪日后，身穿时尚服装，戴着太阳镜，手持现金，面带自信笑容，灯光明亮，背景奢华。添加粗体迷因文字：“{argument name="meme text 1" default="发薪日前 "}” 和 “{argument name="meme text 2" default="发薪日后 "}”。电影级灯光，8K 真实感，锐利细节，病毒式社交媒体风格。', 'https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue', '![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue)

![](https://img.shields.io/badge/🚀-Raycast_Friendly-purple)', 'youmind-nano-banana-pro', '["nano-banana-pro","youtube 缩略图"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-nano-banana-pro-prompts', 1, 1320);
INSERT INTO prompt_library(title, prompt_content, cover_url, preview_content, category, tags_data, source_url, status, sort_order)
VALUES ('YouTube 缩略图 - 好莱坞大片般的街市漫步', '生成一张极具电影感、好莱坞风格的照片，主体人物使用上传图片中的面部。人物自信地穿行于夜晚熙熙攘攘的街市中，街市里灯火辉煌，霓虹闪烁，摊位熠熠生辉。镜头采用略低角度的中景拍摄，营造出一种强劲而富有戏剧性的氛围。周围的人群呈动态模糊，营造出活力与混乱感，而主体人物则清晰锐利，处于焦点之中。冷暖光线交织，倒映在地面和周围环境上。淡淡的烟雾和氛围感增强了场景的深度。人物身着时尚现代的服装，例如夹克、T 恤、牛仔裤和运动鞋。电影级灯光、戏剧性对比、鲜艳色彩、浅景深、超逼真、电影场景构图、8K、好莱坞电影质感。', 'https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue', '![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue)', 'youmind-nano-banana-pro', '["nano-banana-pro","youtube 缩略图"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-nano-banana-pro-prompts', 1, 1321);
INSERT INTO prompt_library(title, prompt_content, cover_url, preview_content, category, tags_data, source_url, status, sort_order)
VALUES ('YouTube 缩略图 - 一名女性在地铁站台上的电影感照片，带有运动模糊', '创作一张逼真的电影感照片，其中女性的面部来自上传的图片。她站在地铁站台上，一列火车在她身后高速驶过，形成动态模糊效果。这名女性静止不动，处于清晰的焦点中，略微侧视，带着平静而自信的表情。她一只手拿着一束用纸包裹的鲜花。服装时尚现代——一件宽松的西装外套、短裙或短裤，以及及膝长靴。灯光柔和但富有电影感，带有车站灯光带来的自然室内色调。背景中，移动的火车模糊成条状的运动轨迹。地面反射着些许光线，增加了深度感。电影感摄影，动态模糊效果，氛围深度，逼真阴影，高细节，美学构图。', 'https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue', '![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue)', 'youmind-nano-banana-pro', '["nano-banana-pro","youtube 缩略图"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-nano-banana-pro-prompts', 1, 1322);
INSERT INTO prompt_library(title, prompt_content, cover_url, preview_content, category, tags_data, source_url, status, sort_order)
VALUES ('YouTube 缩略图 - 如电影般静谧的银色定格', '在 Nano Banana Pro 中探索氛围深度。鲜艳的橙色头发与柔和的银色草地形成对比，营造出一种令人魂牵梦萦的电影画面。👘✨', 'https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue', '![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue)', 'youmind-nano-banana-pro', '["nano-banana-pro","youtube 缩略图"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-nano-banana-pro-prompts', 1, 1323);
INSERT INTO prompt_library(title, prompt_content, cover_url, preview_content, category, tags_data, source_url, status, sort_order)
VALUES ('漫画 / 故事板 - Fantasy Game Character Warrior Jo', 'Create an ultra-realistic 8K cinematic fantasy game character named Jo, a fearless female warrior and legendary role model. She stands confidently on top of a rocky battlefield during a dramatic sunset, wearing black and crimson battle armor with glowing blue energy lines. Her long silver hair flows in the wind, and her determined expression radiates courage and leadership. She holds a {argument name="weapon one" default="massive enchanted sword"} in one hand and a {argument name="weapon two" default="futuristic energy spear"} in the other. Behind her stands a disciplined army of elite warriors carrying banners, shields, swords, and glowing weapons, stretching across the battlefield. The sky is filled with storm clouds, smoke, sparks, and rays of sunlight breaking through. Epic cinematic lighting, volumetric fog, flying embers, highly detailed armor, realistic textures, Unreal Engine 5 quality, AAA game concept art, dynamic composition, ultra-sharp focus, dramatic atmosphere, powerful female commander, no text, no watermark, 16:9.

Create an ultra-realistic 8K cinematic AAA game action scene featuring the exact same female warrior "Jo" from the previous image. Maintain 100% character consistency: same face, same silver-white long flowing hair, same facial features, same body proportions, same black and crimson armor with glowing blue energy accents, same enchanted crimson greatsword in her right hand, same futuristic blue energy spear in her left hand, identical design, colors, accessories, and overall appearance. Jo is in the middle of an intense battlefield, fearlessly charging toward thousands of enemy warriors. She is performing a powerful attack while swinging her glowing crimson sword and simultaneously thrusting her blue energy spear. Enemy soldiers are being pushed back by the force of her attack. Massive explosions, magical shockwaves, flying sparks, shattered weapons, smoke, dust, burning siege machines, collapsing structures, and glowing energy trails fill the battlefield. Behind Jo, her loyal army advances forward under her leadership while enemy forces surround them from every direction. The sky is dark with storm clouds, lightning, fire, and flying embers, creating an epic war atmosphere. Use a dramatic low-angle cinematic camera, dynamic action pose, intense determined facial expression, realistic motion blur, volumetric lighting, god rays, ultra-detailed armor textures, realistic physics for hair and cape, Unreal Engine 5 quality, hyper-realistic, AAA game cinematic, epic fantasy war, maximum detail, no blood, no gore, no text, no watermark, 16:9 aspect ratio. The character must look exactly like the first image with no changes to her appearance.', 'https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue', '![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-EN-blue)

![](https://img.shields.io/badge/🚀-Raycast_Friendly-purple)', 'youmind-nano-banana-pro', '["nano-banana-pro","漫画","故事板"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-nano-banana-pro-prompts', 1, 1324);
