VALUES ('名画人物穿搭', 'Generate different profession-style OOTDs for the person in the image, with fashionable outfits and accessories, a solid-color background matching the character''s color scheme, chibi 3D style, C4D rendering, preserving facial features, keeping all poses consistent, with long slender legs for the character proportions

