INSERT INTO prompt_library(title, prompt_content, cover_url, preview_content, category, tags_data, source_url, status, sort_order)
VALUES ('Q版表情包制作', 'Create a brand new set of chibi stickers, with six unique poses, featuring the user''s likeness as the main character:
1. Making a peace sign with both hands, playfully winking;
2. Teary-eyed with slightly trembling lips, showing a cute crying expression;
3. Arms wide open, making an enthusiastic big hug gesture;
4. Lying on side sleeping, leaning on a mini pillow, with a sweet smile;
5. Confidently pointing forward with hand, surrounded by sparkling effects;
6. Blowing a kiss gesture, with heart emojis floating around.
Maintain chibi aesthetic style: exaggerated expressive big eyes, soft facial lines, lively and playful short black hairstyle, paired with white outfit featuring a bold neckline design, using a vibrant red background, decorated with stars or confetti elements. Leave appropriate white space around the edges.
Aspect ratio: 9:16', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/74.png', 'Chibi Emoji Pack Making

Upload a clear headshot photo.

