VALUES ('名画人物麦片广告', '"Master Oats": Based on the character features in the photo I uploaded, generate a suitable oatmeal pairing for them (such as vegetables, fruits, yogurt, whole grains, etc.) and packaging design, then generate an ad cover featuring them as the cereal box cover character along with the corresponding oatmeal pairing. The character should maintain their features, in a cute chibi 3D style with C4D rendering. The setting where the cereal is placed should also match the theme, such as a kitchen, supermarket, or minimalist design counter, etc. First establish the concept, then generate the image.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/75.png', 'Famous Painting Characters Cereal Ad

Upload a portrait image as reference.

