VALUES ('小红书封面', 'Draw an image: Create a Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) cover.
Requirements:
Have enough appeal to attract users to click;
Use eye-catching fonts, choose distinctive fonts;
Text sizes should be tiered by importance, reflecting the logical structure of the copy;
Title should be at least 2x the size of regular text;
Leave white space between text paragraphs.
Only use appropriate icons or images to add visual hierarchy while minimizing distraction.

Copy: Breaking News! ChatGPT Just Got Even More Powerful!
Multi-task processing is stronger
Coding ability is better
Creativity off the charts
Come try it out!

Image ratio 9:16', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/79.png', 'Xiaohongshu Cover

