VALUES ('Q版角色表情包', 'Please create a set of chibi sticker packs featuring [the character from the reference image] as the main character, 9 in total, arranged in a 3x3 grid.
Design requirements:
- Transparent background.
- 1:1 square composition.
- Unified chibi Ghibli cartoon style with vibrant colors.
- Each sticker should have different actions, expressions, and content, conveying diverse emotions like "sassy, cheeky, cute, going crazy" etc.
- Each sticker should have a complete figure with no missing parts.
- Each sticker should have a uniform white outline for a sticker effect.
- No extra, detached elements in the image.
- Strictly no text, or ensure text content is accurate (prefer no text).', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/80.png', 'Chibi Character Sticker Pack

