VALUES ('国家微缩玩具箱', 'A hyper-realistic overhead photograph showing a 3D-printed diorama inside a beige cardboard box, with the lid held open by two human hands. The interior of the box reveals a miniature landscape of [Country Name], featuring iconic landmarks, terrain, architecture, rivers, vegetation, and numerous tiny detailed figurines. The diorama is filled with vivid, geographically accurate elements, all crafted in a tactile, toy-like style using matte 3D-printed textures with visible print layer lines. At the top, the inside of the box lid displays "[Country Name]" in large, colorful raised plastic letters — each letter a different bright color. The lighting is warm and cinematic, highlighting textures and shadows, creating a sense of realism and charm, as if the viewer is opening a magical miniature version of a country.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/82.png', 'Country Diorama in Toy Box

