VALUES ('信息图设计', 'A {argument name="photography style" default="photorealistic portrait with shallow depth of field and soft bokeh"} of a {argument name="subject" default="young Japanese woman"} looking back over her shoulder at the camera with a {argument name="expression" default="gentle smile"}. She is wearing a {argument name="attire" default="light beige kimono with orange maple leaf patterns"} and a gold obi. Her dark hair is styled in an elegant updo with loose strands framing her face, and she wears small pearl earrings. The background features an {argument name="setting" default="autumn garden with vibrant red maple leaves"}, with bright red foliage framing the top left and a heavily blurred, soft background creating a serene, cinematic atmosphere.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/133.jpg', '人像写实摄影图

