ion of a house and trees at the bottom left.", "call_to_action_button": "説明会へ" } ], "common_elements": "All panels feature a {argument name=\"button style\" default=\"rounded green pill button with white text and a right-pointing arrow icon\"} at the bottom." } }', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/156.jpg', '插画艺术风格创作

