 "MODULE 7: TEAM COLLABORATION", "count": 8, "items": ["Designer", "Patternmaker", "Fabric Buyer", "Sample Maker", "Merchandiser", "QC", "Feedback Loop", "Model"] }, { "module": "MODULE 8: FINAL GARMENT PRESENTATION", "count": 3, "items": ["Details", "Finished Front & Back", "Labels & Care"] }, { "module": "MODULE 9: FINAL WEAR", "count": 3, "items": ["Drape", "Proportion", "Movement in Motion"] }, { "module": "MODULE 10: THE CHAIN SUMMARY", "count": 8, "items": ["Material Foundation", "Aesthetic Judgment", "Structural Engineering", "Craft Realization", "Body Negotiation", "Team Collaboration", "Iterative Revision", "Final Garment"] } ], "footer": "{argument name=\"footer text\" default=\"一件成衣，因无数判断而存在 A garment exists because of countless decisions.\"}" } }', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/160.jpg', '信息图可视化设计

