 title\" default=\"Ellipsography Hardware Setup.\"}", "description": "{argument name=\"figure caption\" default=\"Our prototype display system employs a dual-modulation configuration to achieve simultaneous control of phase and polarization. A 4f relay optics setup transfers the modulated wavefront...\"}" } }', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/170.jpg', '信息图可视化设计

