on": "Examples of incorrect logo usage: stretched, wrong color, drop shadow, tilted, and placed on a busy photographic background" } ] } }', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/215.jpg', '界面交互设计图

