VALUES ('信息图设计', '[中文] 以 3:4 比例制作一家弹珠店那种闪闪发光的宣传单。放置一个真实、精细的现代可爱日本女性。充分利用闪闪发光、立体感丰富的豪华装饰彩虹字体等，务必做到极致奢华。并列介绍几个不存在的虚构新机型。 [English] Create a sparkling flyer like those of a pachinko parlor at a 3:4 aspect ratio. Place a realistic, highly detailed modern cute Japanese woman. Make full use of sparkling, three-dimensional richly decorated rainbow typography, etc., and be sure to achieve extreme luxury. Introduce several non-existent fictional new models side by side.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/368.jpg', '极致奢华的弹珠店梦幻宣传单

![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/368.jpg)', 'davidwu-gpt-image2-prompts', '["信息图设计","infographic","freestylefly","freestylefly","awesome-gpt-image-2"]'::jsonb, 'https://github.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts', 1, 1750);
