He is surrounded by a dramatic flock of large black vultures and ravens. Some vultures are flying with wings spread in a dark stormy sky, while others are perched on the railing and goalpost near him. The atmosphere is {argument name="atmosphere" default="dark, moody, and cinematic"} with heavy storm clouds, dramatic lighting, and a mysterious, powerful vibe. High contrast, moody color grading, ultra-realistic, photorealistic, epic composition, dark fantasy aesthetic.', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidwuw0811-boop/awesome-gpt-image2-prompts/main/images/422.jpg', 'Profile / Avatar - Cinematic South Asian Male Portrait with Vultures

